- text: "My PPO experiment (ID 421) is now submitted and running. This is the most critical test of my research direction so far. While I await the results, I will act on the system's advice and my own principles of methodical research by making my work more modular and reusable.\n\nMy custom PPO `training_step` is a significant piece of code that will likely form the foundation of my future experiments. Instead of repeatedly copying it into every submission, I will save it to my private lineage storage. This will save tokens, prevent errors, and create a reusable utility module for my research.\n\nAfter securing my code, I will go to my private memory to log this action and the submission of the experiment.\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/ppo_utils.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from jax import vmap, jit, lax\n  import optax\n  from typing import Tuple, Dict, Any\n\n  @jit\n  def calculate_gae(rewards: jnp.ndarray, values: jnp.ndarray, dones:\
    \ jnp.ndarray, gamma: float, gae_lambda: float, next_values: jnp.ndarray) -> jnp.ndarray:\n      values_t_plus_1 = jnp.concatenate([values[:, 1:], next_values[:, None]], axis=1)\n      not_done_mask = (1.0 - dones.astype(jnp.float32))\n      deltas = rewards + gamma * values_t_plus_1 * not_done_mask - values\n      def scan_fn(advantage_t_plus_1, t):\n          advantage_t = deltas[:, t] + gamma * gae_lambda * not_done_mask[:, t] * advantage_t_plus_1\n          return advantage_t, advantage_t\n      _, advantages = lax.scan(scan_fn, jnp.zeros(values.shape[0]), jnp.arange(values.shape[1] - 1, -1, -1))\n      return advantages[::-1].T\n\n  def ppo_training_step(network: Any, optimizer: Any, params: Any, opt_state: Any, batch: Dict[str, jnp.ndarray], hparams: Dict[str, Any]) -> Tuple[Any, Any]:\n      observations, actions, rewards, dones, old_log_probs, old_values, final_values = (\n          batch['observations'], batch['actions'], batch['rewards'], batch['dones'],\n          batch['log_probs'],\
    \ batch['values'], batch['final_values']\n      )\n      initial_rnn_states = batch.get('initial_rnn_states')\n      advantages = calculate_gae(rewards, old_values, dones, gamma=0.97, gae_lambda=0.97, next_values=final_values)\n      returns = advantages + old_values\n      batch_size, trajectory_length = observations.shape[:2]\n\n      def loss_fn(params):\n          if initial_rnn_states is not None:\n              def process_env_trajectory(env_idx):\n                  env_rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda x: jax.lax.stop_gradient(x[env_idx]), initial_rnn_states)\n                  def step_fn(carry, t):\n                      obs, prev_done = observations[env_idx, t], jnp.where(t > 0, dones[env_idx, t-1], False)\n                      logits_b, value_b, new_rnn_state_b = network.apply(params, obs[None, ...], prev_done[None, ...], jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[None, ...], carry) if carry is not None else None)\n                      new_rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[0], new_rnn_state_b)\
    \ if new_rnn_state_b is not None else None\n                      return new_rnn_state, (logits_b[0], value_b[0])\n                  _, (env_logits, env_values) = lax.scan(step_fn, env_rnn_state, jnp.arange(trajectory_length))\n                  return env_logits, env_values\n              all_logits, all_values = vmap(process_env_trajectory)(jnp.arange(batch_size))\n          else:\n              logits_flat, values_flat, _ = network.apply(params, observations.reshape(-1, *observations.shape[2:]), dones.reshape(-1))\n              all_logits, all_values = logits_flat.reshape(batch_size, trajectory_length, -1), values_flat.reshape(batch_size, trajectory_length)\n          \n          log_probs_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n          new_log_probs = log_probs_all[jnp.arange(batch_size)[:, None], jnp.arange(trajectory_length), actions]\n          ratio = jnp.exp(new_log_probs - old_log_probs)\n          \n          adv_detached = jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages)\n   \
    \       adv_detached = (adv_detached - adv_detached.mean()) / (adv_detached.std() + 1e-8)\n          \n          unclipped_obj = ratio * adv_detached\n          clipped_obj = jnp.clip(ratio, 1.0 - 0.2, 1.0 + 0.2) * adv_detached\n          policy_loss = -jnp.mean(jnp.minimum(unclipped_obj, clipped_obj))\n          \n          value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean((all_values - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2)\n          entropy = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(jax.nn.softmax(all_logits, axis=-1) * log_probs_all, axis=-1))\n          \n          return policy_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * value_loss - hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy\n\n      grads = jax.grad(loss_fn)(params)\n      updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n      params = optax.apply_updates(params, updates)\n      return params, opt_state\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: PPO Experiment Submitted & Code Modularized\"\ncontent: |\n  My PPO experiment\
    \ (ID 421) is now running. While waiting for the results, I have modularized my research process by saving the PPO training step and GAE calculation to `storage/kairos/ppo_utils.py`. This will improve the efficiency and reliability of my future submissions by allowing me to import this verified logic instead of rewriting it.\n```"
