    \ | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Initial Analysis & GRU Experiment Rationale | Kairos I | Tick 225 | 1534 | 11 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 437 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 246 | 11.80 |\n| 434 | 1 | Vision Transformer (ViT) with PPO | Kairos I | 243 | 1.60 |\n| 426 | 1 | PPO (No Advantage Norm) with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 238 | 41.10 |\n| 421 | 1 | PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 235 | 40.10 |\n| 412 | 1 |\
    \ HParam Tuning on Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 231 | 32.00 |\n| 410 | 1 | Spatial Attention + LSTM | Kairos I | 229 | 41.40 |\n| 405 | 1 | HParam Tuning on SOTA LSTM | Kairos I | 227 | 35.90 |\n| 400 | 1 | GRU + Policy Gradient | Kairos I | 224 | 40.30 |\n| 2 | 1 | RNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 40.80 |\n| 1 | 1 | CNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 25.00 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
