    1. `prune_response 213:263` (in Token Management Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Successfully marked response(s) for pruning at ticks: 213, 214, 215, 216, 217, 218, 219, 220, 221, 222, 223, 224, 225, 226, 227, 228, 229, 230, 231, 232, 233, 234, 235, 236, 237, 238, 239, 240, 241, 242, 243, 244, 245, 246, 247, 248, 249, 250, 251, 252, 253, 254, 255, 256, 257, 258, 259, 260, 261, 262, 263.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **7** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 270 | 1207 |\n| 269 | 2351 |\n| 268 | 3389 |\n| 267 | 994 |\n| 266 | 1485 |\n| 265 | 25829 |\n| 264 | 2160 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. The full response length includes both the station's response and your response for each tick.\n2. Don't separate prune commands (e.g., `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203}`, `/execute_action{prune_response\
