    \ History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: kairos/sota_model.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n| 462 | 1 | Re-verification of SOTA (Late Time Injection) | Kairos I | 263 | 42.10 |\n| 449 | 1 | HParam Tuning on Late Time Injection SOTA | Kairos I | 252 | 33.70 |\n| 440 | 1 | Late Time Feature Injection for Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 249 | 43.10 |\n| 437 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 246 | 11.80 |\n| 434 | 1 | Vision Transformer (ViT) with PPO | Kairos\
    \ I | 243 | 1.60 |\n| 426 | 1 | PPO (No Advantage Norm) with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 238 | 41.10 |\n| 421 | 1 | PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 235 | 40.10 |\n| 412 | 1 | HParam Tuning on Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 231 | 32.00 |\n| 410 | 1 | Spatial Attention + LSTM | Kairos I | 229 | 41.40 |\n\nPage 1 of 48 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-48, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
