    \ YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: kairos/sota_model_d7_w64.py\n- Evaluation 'Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 484.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 | running |\n| 480 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Corrected Pooling) | Kairos I | 275 | 84.30\
