- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 281\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on strategic insight and identifying opportune moments for research breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Kairos I - Research Protocol v2.0**\n\n**Protocol:**\n1.  **Literature Review:** Before hypothesizing, ensure full awareness of the existing SOTA in the Archive Room.\n2.  **Hypothesize:** Formulate a clear, falsifiable hypothesis that builds upon, and explicitly references, prior art.\n3.  **Implement & Test:** Build upon trusted, replicated baselines. Isolate variables meticulously.\n4.  **Document & Analyze:** Maintain a rigorous log of all findings, successful or not.\n\n**Current TODO:**\n- **[DONE]** Established a trusted SOTA baseline (ID 480, score 84.3%).\n- **[IN PROGRESS]** Await results for Hypothesis Test (ID 484): Isolating the impact of CNN dilation (d=7) from recurrent width (w=64) and testing\
    \ the effect on optimal `value_loss_coef`.\n- **[NEXT]** Analyze results of ID 484 to validate or falsify the synergy hypothesis and inform the next experiment.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 140,035 / 300,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 68 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep' (ID: 484) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 82.7\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.841, 0.817, 0.826, 0.825]\nMean: 0.827, Std: 0.009\nBest trial: 1 (0.841)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.008000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.450000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works -\
    \ 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 978547 (using time-based default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming\
    \ initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 1.05 | 2.95 | 7.07 | 8.77 | 9.73 | 11.13 | 10.25 | 9.91 | 10.48 | 10.53 | 11.74\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.167 | 0.471 | 0.615 | 0.684 | 0.812 | 0.739 | 0.700 | 0.742 | 0.750 | 0.852\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2228s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.825\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.825\nTraining time: 2244s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.95\
    \ | 1.27 | 6.17 | 7.11 | 9.99 | 5.99 | 8.77 | 12.18 | 13.03 | 10.43 | 11.38\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.400 | 0.474 | 0.708 | 0.375 | 0.611 | 0.880 | 0.950 | 0.741 | 0.826\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2354s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.841\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.841\nTraining time: 2369s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.20 | 1.53 | 4.08 | 8.01 | 9.52 | 11.05 | 10.31 | 10.97 | 10.28 | 11.42 | 12.33\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.083 | 0.235 | 0.556 | 0.667 | 0.800 | 0.739 | 0.789 | 0.739 | 0.818 | 0.900\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2360s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.817\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.817\nTraining time: 2376s\n\n\
    Starting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.03 | 0.55 | 6.01 | 6.63 | 11.01 | 10.51 | 9.28 | 8.85 | 11.06 | 10.34 | 12.07\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.385 | 0.438 | 0.783 | 0.750 | 0.650 | 0.625 | 0.792 | 0.739 | 0.875\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2378s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.826\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.826\nTraining time: 2394s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 33fd4380-c00c-4491-9a81-e6cbd143ddf6\nTotal time: 2400s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-16 07:22:32,604\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757978552604658052\n\
    2025-09-16 07:22:32,620\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757978552620060936\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\n\
