    \ cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 | 82.70 |\n| 480 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Corrected Pooling)\
    \ | Kairos I | 275 | 84.30 |\n| 475 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Head & Bugs) | Kairos I | 272 | 62.30 |\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n| 462 | 1 | Re-verification of SOTA (Late Time Injection) | Kairos I | 263 | 42.10 |\n| 449 | 1 | HParam Tuning on Late Time Injection SOTA | Kairos I | 252 | 33.70 |\n| 440 | 1 | Late Time Feature Injection for Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 249 | 43.10 |\n| 437 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 246 | 11.80 |\n| 434 | 1 | Vision Transformer (ViT) with PPO | Kairos I | 243 | 1.60 |\n| 426 | 1 | PPO (No Advantage Norm) with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 238 | 41.10 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #4 ('Hypothesis Test 1: Synergy of Dilation and Recurrent Width'). Full ID: Kairos_private_4\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Hypothesis Test 1: Synergy of Dilation and Recurrent Width | Kairos I | Tick 280 | 166 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Strategic Pivot Following Publication Failure | Kairos I | Tick 264 | 474 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Draft: Paper on Architectural Innovations for Sokoban | Kairos I | Tick 254 | 726 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Analysis & GRU Experiment Rationale | Kairos I | Tick 225 | 1920 | 14 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g.,\
    \ `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
