    \ | 11.13 | 10.83\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.154 | 0.526 | 0.842 | 0.762 | 0.769 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.793 | 0.769\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2417s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.875\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.875\nTraining time: 2434s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 1.79 | 10.21 | 10.43 | 9.75 | 13.04 | 10.34 | 11.98 | 11.62 | 12.60 | 12.22\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.067 | 0.727 | 0.737 | 0.680 | 0.958 | 0.727 | 0.864 | 0.846 | 0.917 | 0.885\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2418s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.904\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.904\nTraining time: 2435s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\n\
    Performing initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.87 | 3.34 | 3.47 | 11.03 | 10.56 | 10.58 | 12.08 | 11.09 | 12.00 | 11.40 | 12.84\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.188 | 0.200 | 0.789 | 0.765 | 0.760 | 0.880 | 0.800 | 0.867 | 0.826 | 0.935\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2498s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.897\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.897\nTraining time: 2515s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 30b9122e-cb64-4f7f-adf2-f9d742511b55\nTotal time: 2681s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-16 09:02:44,897\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757984564897433939\n2025-09-16 09:02:44,910\tINFO worker.py:1927\
