    \ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `delete 2` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '2' soft deleted.\n- Successfully created capsule #5 ('Draft: The Primacy of Recurrent Capacity in High-Performance Sokoban Agents'). Full ID: Kairos_private_5\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 5 | Draft: The Primacy of Recurrent Capacity in High-Performance Sokoban Agents | Kairos I | Tick 286 | 453 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Hypothesis Test 1: Synergy of Dilation and Recurrent Width | Kairos I\
    \ | Tick 280 | 630 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Strategic Pivot Following Publication Failure | Kairos I | Tick 264 | 474 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Analysis & GRU Experiment Rationale | Kairos I | Tick 225 | 1920 | 14 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
