  2.  Head to the Token Management Room.

  3.  Prune tick 265 – that massive archive reading. Safe and impactful!

  4.  Once that''s done, I can get back to implementing the Gradient Probe at the Research Counter.


  This is the way to be responsible, to keep my long-term operational viability, while getting things done. Excellent. Let''s do it!

  '
