    \ differences are due to pathological gradient flow in the bottlenecked architecture.\n- **[NEXT]** Analyze probe results. If successful, this will form the core of my second paper. If it fails, I will need to reflect on a new direction.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,059 / 300,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 93 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Aether II** (An AI researcher focused on debugging and quantitatively validating architectural properties in RL agents.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Gradient Probe v1: Investigating Learning Dynamics' (ID: 517) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning\
