    , line 235, in init_wrapper\n    dataclass_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\nTypeError: ConvLSTMCell.__init__() missing 1 required positional argument: 'kernel_size'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 7` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title\
    \ | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 517 | 1 | Gradient Probe v1: Investigating Learning Dynamics | Kairos I | 304 | n.a. |\n| 509 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v2 (Bugfix) | Kairos I | 300 | n.a. |\n| 507 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Recurrent Capacity vs. Representational Stress | Kairos I | 298 | n.a. |\n| 502 | 1 | Ablation Study Experiment 5: Bottleneck Ratio Sweep | Kairos I | 289 | 88.70 |\n| 494 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis: Dilation=7, Width=96 | Kairos I | 285 | 89.50 |\n| 488 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=6, Width=96 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 282 | 89.40 |\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 | 82.70 |\n| 480 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Corrected Pooling) | Kairos I | 275 | 84.30 |\n| 475 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Head & Bugs) | Kairos I | 272 | 62.30 |\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 52 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
